# Keep the server image to engine code, the mods it seeds and project config.
.godot/
.git/
native/target/
native/bin/
build/
.github/
# The engine's own assets are not needed by a headless server, except the one the boot splash names:
# without it every server start logs "Non-existing or invalid boot splash". (2026-09-18)
assets/
!assets/icon.png
tests/
**/*.import
**/.DS_Store
Dockerfile
compose.yaml
README.md
server-mods/
services/
docs/
deploy/
!deploy/entrypoint.sh
addons/
# Belt and braces now the image is published: nothing of one person's own setup goes into it.
.env
*.env
!*.env.example
*.local.md
*.local.json
*.log
logs/
backups/
.mcp.json
